      "publication": "Vogue (US)",
      "quote": "Something of a travel miracle: an away-from-it-all retreat that is also just a 13-minute drive from Nice Airport.",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "publication": "Forbes (US)",
      "quote": "Devoted to everything that is pleasurable to see, to touch, to taste, to breathe in. It's delightfully analog.",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "publication": "The Times (UK)",
      "quote": "Subtle good taste everywhere — from the quietly luxurious suites to the excellent restaurant with its superb wine list.",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "publication": "Homes & Gardens (UK)",
      "quote": "The grounds of the hotel are like an open gallery, a sculpture park for modern art from both local and global artists.",
      "year": "2026"
    },
    {
      "publication": "Mr & Mrs Smith (UK)",
      "quote": "The Leroy brothers, artists and hoteliers in equal measure, have created something special.",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "publication": "Robb Report Monaco",
      "quote": "A restful blend of contemporary art, Provençal charm and understated luxury.",
      "year": "2025"
